  "title": "StyleID++",
  "summary": "StyleID++ introduces a training-free framework to address coordinate-dependent matching in diffusion architectures, reducing the leakage of position signals and improving style coherence. It also enables affinity-coherent refinement by leveraging content self-attention.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "StyleID++ addresses coordinate-dependent matching by reducing position signals through circular padding in U-Nets and injection-only RoPE removal in DiTs.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "StyleID++ prevents unconstrained global retrieval by maintaining native position modeling and enforcing content tokens to select compatible style regions.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "StyleID++ quantifies the leakage with coordinate--centroid correlation and a permutation test showing it can be driven to zero in both backbones.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
